# Engine / server

- `sim_engine/` (the engine package: `core.py` + `constants.py`/`persistence.py`/`helpers.py` + `mixin_*.py`) owns all world state; mutate only under `self.lock`. LLM calls stay outside the lock.
- `server.py` = Flask + cognition (`normalize_decision`). `roles.json` = sole role source of truth.
- Think cycle: snapshot under lock → `run_agent_decision` → `apply_decision` under lock.
- `MAX_CONCURRENT_LLM = 3`. Keep `WORLD_W`/`WORLD_H` matched with `viewer/setup.js`.
- God routes (`/control/god/*`) are not decision actions; audit via `divine.jsonl`.
- New/changed actions: see action-sync rule / [specs/07-actions.md](specs/07-actions.md).
- Workflow: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Ops: [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md).
